            <ArticleTitle>Unusual cause of wrist pain in a golfer.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e34</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Wrist injury is common in golfers and normally occurs at the impact of the club with the ball. The unusual case is reported of a low handicap golfer with wrist pain aggravated by the putting stroke. The condition was resolved with treatment. The likely mechanism for the injury is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
